          "content": "Same Tanker wordmark on both sizes. Desktop: recessed Work tab plus cobalt underline, 48 px link targets. Mobile: 48 px labelled menu; use aria-expanded and a close control. Home is the wordmark link. Never communicate selection with color alone.",
