                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Withavelle needed an online storefront that matched their refined brand identity while keeping the shopping journey effortless. Off-the-shelf Shopify themes couldn't deliver the level of visual polish and layout control the brand required without sacrificing performance.",
